      "count": 9,
      "missable": false,
      "guide": "Rob 1 illegal operation of each of 9 gangs (39 operations total).",
      "tip": "Explore different regions of Leonida to find each gang's illegal operations. There are 9 gang types total. Use the map to locate gang territories. Robbing one operation per gang type counts - you don't need to rob all 39 operations, just one from each of the 9 gangs.",
