      "missable": false,
      "guide": "PowerPyx lists this as unknown at launch. The description suggests enjoying a cocktail with a view on Ocean Beach. This likely involves visiting a bar or beachside location on Ocean Beach and ordering a cocktail. The exact trigger/method is still being confirmed at launch - the description simply suggests a cocktail with a view.",
      "tip": "Visit Ocean Beach area and look for bars, cafes, or beachfront locations. Order a cocktail at an establishment with a view of the ocean. The exact location may require exploration - look for venues with outdoor seating facing the water.",
