      "guide": "After Key Cloner (Ch3 Clonin' Keys), steal the blue Banshee from the south Vice City showroom and drive through its window.",
      "tip": "After Chapter 3 \"Clonin' Keys,\" locate the blue Banshee showroom in south Vice City. Steal the displayed Banshee. Drive the car through the showroom's main glass entrance/window to complete the stunt. Best done with a running start for maximum impact.",
